@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Listar categorias
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Criar categoria
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mercado" }

### Criar categoria inválida (espera 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

### Excluir categoria
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/1